     "body": "<p>Hi  <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5d302b1f929dcd0c86b9bb4f\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5d302b1f929dcd0c86b9bb4f\" data-account-id=\"5d302b1f929dcd0c86b9bb4f\" accountid=\"5d302b1f929dcd0c86b9bb4f\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Jenny A'Brook</a>.  Thank you for the contribution and for being willing to run through the process in advance of the sprint.</p>\n\n<p>As a matter of process, would you mind clicking the \"Start Work\" button.  Since you've already completed the work,  you can then go ahead and hit the \"Review\" button.   Once the review is complete, I will merge and close this ticket.  If there is some need for updates to the pull request,  I will \"Reopen\" the issue. Then once you've addressed any feedback,  you can hit \"Review\" and we keep cycling until the code is merged. </p>",
