  "description": "<p>The task at hand is to address the following warnings in the fcrepo-http-api module.</p>\n\n<p>Once these issues are resolved when you build the module using this command</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nmvn clean install -pl fcrepo-http-api</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>the following warnings should no longer appear in the output:</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> Javadoc Warnings</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> /Users/danny/code/fcrepo4/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/ContentExposingResource.java:1116: warning: no @param for checksum<br/>\n <span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> protected static URI checksumURI( final String checksum ) {<br/>\n <span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> ^<br/>\n <span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> /Users/danny/code/fcrepo4/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/ContentExposingResource.java:1116: warning: no @return<br/>\n <span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> protected static URI checksumURI( final String checksum ) {<br/>\n <span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> ^<br/>\n <span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> /Users/danny/code/fcrepo4/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraVersioning.java:139: warning: no @param for rawLinks<br/>\n <span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> public Response addVersion(@HeaderParam(MEMENTO_DATETIME_HEADER) final String datetimeHeader,<br/>\n <span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> ^</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> /Users/danny/code/fcrepo4/fcrepo-http-api/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/integration/http/api/FedoraTransactionsIT.java:360: warning: no @throws for java.lang.Exception<br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> public void testHeadAndDeleteInTransaction() throws Exception {<